      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Model\n\nDownload [MoGe 3 ViT-g FP16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MoGe/blob/main/geometry_estimation/moge_3_vitg_fp16.safetensors) and put the file here:\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n└── models/\n    └── geometry_estimation/\n        └── moge_3_vitg_fp16.safetensors\n```\n\nRestart ComfyUI, then select the file in **Load MoGe Model**.\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Choose your background photo in **Load Image**.\n2. **Run once** to load the photo and its surface into **Slap Stickers**.\n3. Drop a sticker image onto the photo, or click **+**.\n4. Drag to move, use the corners to resize, and the round handle to rotate. The bottom toolbar controls opacity, duplication, layer order and deletion.\n5. **Run again** to send the edited image to **Preview Image**.\n\n> First run: load the surface. Edit in the node. Run again: update the output.\n\n## Sharing a workflow\n\nSticker files are saved in `ComfyUI/input/slap_stickers/`. Share those files together with the workflow.\n\n[Official MoGe setup guide](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/docs/blob/main/tutorials/utility/moge.mdx)\n"
      ],
      "pos": [
        -500,
        30
      ],
      "size": [
        440,
        420
      ],
      "color": "#323",
      "bgcolor": "#535",
      "order": 5,
      "flags": {},
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Model\n\nDownload [MoGe 3 ViT-g FP16](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MoGe/blob/main/geometry_estimation/moge_3_vitg_fp16.safetensors) and put the file here:\n\n```text\nComfyUI/\n└── models/\n    └── geometry_estimation/\n        └── moge_3_vitg_fp16.safetensors\n```\n\nRestart ComfyUI, then select the file in **Load MoGe Model**.\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Choose your background photo in **Load Image**.\n2. **Run once** to load the photo and its surface into **Slap Stickers**.\n3. Drop a sticker image onto the photo, or click **+**.\n4. Drag to move, use the corners to resize, and the round handle to rotate. The bottom toolbar controls opacity, duplication, layer order and deletion.\n5. **Run again** to send the edited image to **Preview Image**.\n\n> First run: load the surface. Edit in the node. Run again: update the output.\n\n## Sharing a workflow\n\nSticker files are saved in `ComfyUI/input/slap_stickers/`. Share those files together with the workflow.\n\n[Official MoGe setup guide](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/docs/blob/main/tutorials/utility/moge.mdx)\n"
      }
